# telemetry/.gitkeep — placeholder so the telemetry directory exists in tree.
#
# Rows (telemetry/runs.jsonl, telemetry/findings.jsonl, telemetry/dispositions.jsonl)
# are git-ignored per .gitignore. The directory itself must exist so the
# aggregator and the wrapper scripts have a stable path; this file is the
# place-holder that keeps it in version control.

